nView project ›](/ad-click/900040)\n\n## 📰 Latest Mumbai Property News\n\n[View all news →](/news)\n\n[![Dhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8ab151e7dd57.png)\n\nArticles\n\nDhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines\n\n📅 28 Sep 2026](/news/2001893/dhuleva-plans-1-000-crore-redevelopment-near-marine-lines)[![Mumbai MMR Targets $1.5 Trillion Economy by 2047](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/1db71ca6a520.jpg)\n\nArticles\n\nMumbai MMR Targets $1.5 Trillion Economy by 2047\n\n📅 04 Sep 2026](/news/2001923/mumbai-mmr-targets-1-5-trillion-economy-by-2047)[![HC Clears Development of 48-Acre Swadeshi Mills Land in Mumbai](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/0445cfc31f2f.jpg)\n\nArticles\n\nHC Clears Development of 48-Acre Swadeshi Mills Land in Mumbai\n\n📅 04 Sep 2026](/news/2001910/hc-clears-development-of-48-acre-swadeshi-mills-land-in-mumbai)[![Kamdhenu Realities Buys 4-Acre Navi Mumbai Land for ₹150 Crore](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/06ac4371a40f.jpg)\n\nArticles\n\nKamdhenu Realities Buys 4-Acre Navi Mumbai Land for ₹150 Crore\n\n📅 01 Sep 2026](/news/2001905/kamdhenu-realities-buys-4-acre-navi-mumbai-land-for-150-crore)","images":[]},{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/rohan-lifescapes/rohan-aashiana-125266","title":"Rohan Aashiana, Malabar Hill, Mumbai | 4 BHK Ultra Luxury Apartments | Houssed","raw_content":"![Houssed](/assets/images/houssed_logo.svg)\n![whatsapp](/assets/images/whatsapp.svg)\n![Project Image of Rohan Aashiana in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 209303](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125266/Project%20Image/2-1737806510.webp)\n![Amenities of Rohan Aashiana in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 209304](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125266/Amenities/6-1737806517.webp)\n![Sample Apartment of Rohan Aashiana in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 209305](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125266/Sample%20Apartment/5-1737806524.webp)\n![Sample Apartment of Rohan Aashiana in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 209306](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125266/Sample%20Apartment/1-1737806524.webp)\n![Sample Apartment of Rohan Aashiana in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 209307](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125266/Sample%20Apartment/3-1737806524.webp)\n![Sample Apartment of Rohan Aashiana in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 209308](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125266/Sample%20Apartment/4-1737806524.webp)\n![Location of Rohan Aashiana in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 209309](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125266/Location/MAP-1737806545.webp)\n\n## Project Overview of Rohan Aashiana Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nNo. of Units\n\n17 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n1 Acres\n\nOwnership\n\nFreehold\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers  / 18 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Rohan Aashiana Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![4 BHK Flat in Rohan Aashiana in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 828817](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125266/BHK_Configuration/4-5500-1737806891.webp)\n\nCarpet Area\n\n5500 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n37 Cr\n\n![Floor Plan of Rohan Aashiana in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 209310](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/125266/Floor%20Plan/FP-1737806556.webp)\n\n## Key Features of Rohan Aashiana Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n## Amenities Rohan Aashiana Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n### Convenience\n\n### Safety\n\n### Sports\n\n### Leisure\n\n### Environment\n\n### Home Specifications\n\n## Google Map Location of Rohan Aashiana Malabar Hill\n\n## Locality Overview of Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n[Malabar Hill](/location-review/mumbai/malabar-hill-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Malabar Hill region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Malabar Hill is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\nRohan Aashiana is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Rohan Aashiana Malabar Hill\n\n### Hospital\n\n### Restaurant\n\n### Shopping\n\n### School\n\n![Rohan Lifescapes](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/696_1678040176_unwdwegtitled-1.webp)\n\n## [Rohan Lifescapes](/mumbai/sale/builder/rohan-lifescapes-696)\n\nOngoing Projects: 1\n\nCompleted Projects: 20\n\nTotal Projects: 21\n\n![blog image](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/ProductPage/2025/12/5-1737806524-1766735204.webp)\n\n## About Rohan Aashiana, Mumbai, Malabar Hill\n\n[Rohan Aashiana](https://houssed.com/mumbai/rohan-lifescapes/rohan-aashiana-125266), developed by Rohan Lifescapes, is a premium residential project in [Malabar Hill](https://houssed.com/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury) that defines luxury in South Mumbai. It prioritizes what luxury homebuyers in Mumbai especially value most: privacy, thoughtful design, and long-term comfort. It has always been about space, distance from the noise, and peace.\n\n## 1. Why are ultra-luxury buyers drawn towards this project?\n\n### Architectural Distinction and Boutique Positioning\n\nThe building’s architecture follows a modern, elegant aesthetic which combines smoothly into Malabar Hill’s calm rather than competing with it. Clean lines, balanced proportions, and thoughtful elevation design define the structure.\n\n### Privacy, Security, and Exclusivity Factors\n\nPrivacy is no longer optional. It's a requirement. With a limited number of residences and controlled access, the project offers a level of discretion that larger developments simply cannot. Excellent security systems, limited entry, and a professionally managed entrance ensure safety without making the building feel restrictive.\n\n## 2. The Neighbourhood and Surroundings\n\nA Lifestyle connected by the Sea & the City\n\nMalabar Hill’s greatest luxury is its location. Located close to the coastline, residents enjoy proximity to serene [sea views](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/flats/property-view/sea-view), the seafront, and iconic landmarks like Hanging Gardens and [Walkeshwar](https://houssed.com/mumbai-walkeshwar/sale/flats).\n\nWithin minutes, residents can access high-end cafes, fine-dining restaurants, boutique bars, exclusive clubs, and private social venues. This smooth combination of tranquillity and urban vibrancy allows homeowners to enjoy quiet mornings and sophisticated evenings without long commutes.\n\n### Healthcare & Leisure Close at Hand\n\nWorld-class hospitals and premium healthcare facilities are located within short driving distances. This makes sure that residents not only enjoy luxury but also convenience and security.\n\nLeisure spaces like art galleries, heritage walks, and cultural venues add to the neighborhood’s intellectual and lifestyle richness, elements often overlooked in modern luxury corridors.\n\n### Metro Connectivity & Infrastructure Upgrades\n\nWith ongoing metro developments and infrastructure enhancements, Malabar Hill’s connectivity is set to improve further. Upcoming metro lines will significantly reduce travel times to business districts, airports, and entertainment hubs, enhancing daily convenience without altering the neighborhood’s exclusivity.\n\n## 3. Connectivity and Daily Travel Convenience\n\n### Seamless Access to South and Central Mumbai\n\nThe project offers strong road connectivity to key areas of South Mumbai locations such as Marine Drive, Nariman Point, Fort, and [Lower Parel](https://houssed.com/mumbai-lower.parel.east/sale/flats/segment/premium). All these make daily travel manageable for professionals, business owners, and families with multi-point city routines.\n\nCentral Mumbai corridors are also reachable within a shorter commute time, which makes the location practical beyond its reputed value.\n\n### Connectivity to Business, Social, and Leisure Hubs\n\nFrom corporate offices and legal districts to luxury retail and fine dining zones, it allows residents to move between professional and personal spaces hassle-free.\n\n### Impact of Upcoming Metro Connectivity\n\nWith ongoing metro and road infrastructure developments in Mumbai, connectivity from Malabar Hill is expected to improve over time. While the area itself is protected from overdevelopment, improved access to neighboring zones increases its long-term livability and value.\n\n## 4. Notable Landmarks\n\nOne of the biggest strengths of this project is its proximity to Mumbai’s most iconic landmarks:\n\nHanging Gardens\n\nKamala Nehru Park\n\nMarine Drive\n\nGirgaon Chowpatty\n\nWalkeshwar Temple precinct\n\n## 5. Ultra-Luxury Real Estate Market Performance\n\nMalabar Hill is one of the most consistent markets in Mumbai. Price movements here are steady rather than sharp. Demand comes from genuine end-users rather than speculative buyers. Properties in this micro-market usually have lower transaction volumes but high holding periods. It's exactly this stability that continues to attract serious buyers into the area.\n\n## 6. Is this project worth investing in?\n\nIf investment is solely viewed through short-term appreciation, Malabar Hill may not always appear aggressive. Although, for buyers focusing on capital preservation, rental stability, and long-term relevance, projects like Rohan Aashiana make the best fit.\n\nRohan Aashiana is specifically designed for buyers who prefer privacy and peace. The project reflects that philosophy with restraint and care.\n\n## FAQ's about Rohan Aashiana Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n# Rohan Aashiana Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nBHK\n\n4 BHK\n\nCarpet Area\n\n5000 - 5500 Sq Ft\n\nPossession\n\nReady to Move\n\nProperty Type\n\nFlat\n\n₹ 37 Cr - 38 Cr\n\nRera No.\n\nRera Approved\n\nDeveloped By\n\nRohan Lifescapes\n\n## Get in Touch with Houssed Associate\n\n![Find Homes by Drive Time](/assets/images/FindHomesByDriveTime.svg)\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Malabar Hill\n\n### Discover Homes in Malabar Hill\n\n### Explore Projects in Malabar Hill\n\n### Homes by BHK in Malabar Hill\n\n### Homes by Budget in Malabar Hill\n\n### Homes by View in Malabar Hill\n\n### Explore Nearby Localities\n\n![Houssed Logo](/assets/images/houssed_logo_white.svg)\n\nA Customer-First Real Estate Platform Powered by Trusted Agents, Built on Transparency.\n\n### Houssed\n\n### Search\n\n### Support\n\n![email](/assets/images/email.svg)\n\n### Download Agent App\n\n![Download on the App Store](/assets/images/iosstore.webp)\n![Get it on Google Play](/assets/images/playstore.webp)\n\nDisclaimer: The information on this platform, including property listings, project details, and pricing, is for general informational purposes only. While we strive for accuracy, we make no warranties about the completeness or reliability of any content. Users should independently verify all information before making any purchasing or investment decisions. This platform does not constitute an offer or recommendation to buy or sell property. We disclaim any liability for loss or damage arising from use of or reliance on this information. All trademarks, logos, and images belong to their respective owners and are used for identification purposes only.\n\n© 2026 Houssed Technologies Pvt Ltd. All rights reserved.","images":[]}],"failed_results":[{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/runwal-malabar-malabar-hill-south-mumbai-npxid-r462665","error":"Failed to fetch url"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/rohan-lifescapes-aashiana-na